<title>SRI LANKA: Commercial dips on retail selling.</title>
<headline>Commercial dips on retail selling.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of blue-chip Commercial Bank of Ceylon Ltd fell 1.5 percent, or three rupees, to 197, in early Friday trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Some small investors who got in when the share was around 125 rupees earlier this year, are selling,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>Commercial Bank is one of four private commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
